# Greenbone vulnerability scanner

GVM is part of the Open-Source Vulnerability Management suite of products produced by Greenbone Networks GmbH. The GVM scanner is one of the most widely used open-source vulnerability scanners. Unlike Nmap, GVM uses a graphical user interface to initiate scans and report vulnerability scan results. scan a well-known vulnerable host, Metasploitable, and then determine how to formulate attacks to take advantage of the vulnerabilities.

